  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 32894a47d08dcf74f823c37621cbcf65, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tipText: {fileID: 976234057}
  tips:
  - If your tank is hiccuping then it is too heavy for its engine.
  - Unless it is artillery, bullets travel in a straight line.
  - The penalty for using coms increases with the number of your alive teammates.
  - Mobility can be your best defense.
  - Study enemy patterns to predict their moves.
  - Coordinate your team using Coms in the Ai Editor.
  - You can edit any purchased Ai files.
  - Click component names and it will show stats and description
  - 'Change tank component colors with slider in the shop to help identify them '
  - 'Winning returns you the fee plus the fee value multiplied by alive tanks '
  - Click and drag during arena matches to adjust your camera
  - If you win the round check the shop for new items!
  - Turret vision is limited, check its stats by clicking a component name
  - When camera follows a tank the debugs in the top left will tell you what branch
    its using
  - Ai files add 1 weight per 10 nodes
